{
  "bodyHash": "rRztpfuNwAk=",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162613103-be7451da-e652-4ed5-951c-57fb5f6d4b03.png\" width=\"1344\" height=\"820\"></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617338-99fd4cdb-b4d1-4594-8bd3-3f881f0f0608.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"><br>怪物占领了你的村庄！</span><span style=\"font-size:18px\">你的世界不再生成原版村庄，而是生成被各种怪物占据的敌对村庄。</span></p><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162617552-80038ed3-026b-42e1-8133-c00f6f9ad45e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">敌对村庄中生成的怪物数量</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">设置哪些怪物可以占据敌对村庄</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">村庄中额外的战利品箱子生成，以及它们包含的物品</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">原版村庄的生成几率，默认情况下所有村庄都会变成敌对村庄</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px\">禁止村民生成，默认情况下村民会被怪物取代（在配置中开启保留村民可防止此效果）</span></li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162635503-85e3e64b-3263-4498-944e-ba9741a3c88d.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1344\" height=\"50\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如果你喜欢这个模组，请考虑支持开发，任何支持都将不胜感激。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开发是一项无报酬的业余活动，因此任何支持都有助于我投入更多时间进行开发。</span><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">你可以在 Patreon 上支持我，或者只是帮忙宣传一下。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/someaddons\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/162637017-9a30d47b-493d-4743-9029-ac09dcc438f9.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"29\"></a></p><p>截图：</p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146149-9062f200-a055-11eb-823a-817b748ded92.png\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146152-93f67900-a055-11eb-8c63-4e3dbecb03f1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146154-9658d300-a055-11eb-827c-f74ee4c04bed.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146158-99ec5a00-a055-11eb-84e2-882c147342b3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/38401808/115146159-9ce74a80-a055-11eb-9e8f-3e53865ee269.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"488\"></p>\n</div>",
